        "imageUrl2": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max500/123300046.jpg?k=d52ada230278dc2e20ad342a98b6f6e404219e744851bedb78aeb643e9aed4d1&o=",
        "description_fr": "Situé sur une plage tranquille, l’Alunan Resort offre une expérience moderne et tranquille.\nPlongez dans la seule piscine à débordement de Perhentians surplombant une falaise.\nAdmirez le coucher de soleil légendaire lors de notre croisière au coucher du soleil dans le premier et unique yacht de sport de l’île.\nNous pratiquons les recommandations de plongée en apnée verte avec des guides formés à Emergency First Rescue (EFR).\nDonnez un sens à vos vacances en participant au projet Alunan Coral et à nos 4 biologistes marins internes\nRevêtues de parquet, les chambres climatisées disposent d’une terrasse privée bien exposée, d’un bureau, d’un portant à vêtements et d’une télévision par satellite à écran plat.",
        "description_en": "Situated on a quiet beach, Alunan Resort offers a modern and tranquil experience.\nSoak in Perhentians' only infinity pool overlooking a cliff.\nView the legendary sunset on our Sunset Cruise in the island's first and only Sport Yacht.\nWe practice green snorkeling recommendations with Emergency First Rescue (EFR) trained guides.\nMake your holiday meaningful by participating in the Alunan Coral Project and our 4 in-house Marine Biologists\nOffering sea views from the private sundeck, air-conditioned rooms are furnished with parquet flooring, a desk, clothes rack and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. The en suite bathroom includes shower facility, towels and free toiletries.\nThis non-smoking property houses a 2 restaurants serving an appetising selection of local and Western cuisine.",
        "description_es": "Situated on a quiet beach, Alunan Resort offers a modern and tranquil experience.\nSoak in Perhentians' only infinity pool overlooking a cliff.\nView the legendary sunset on our Sunset Cruise in the island's first and only Sport Yacht.\nWe practice green snorkeling recommendations with Emergency First Rescue (EFR) trained guides.\nMake your holiday meaningful by participating in the Alunan Coral Project and our 4 in-house Marine Biologists\nOffering sea views from the private sundeck, air-conditioned rooms are furnished with parquet flooring, a desk, clothes rack and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. The en suite bathroom includes shower facility, towels and free toiletries.\nThis non-smoking property houses a 2 restaurants serving an appetising selection of local and Western cuisine.",
        "description_pt": null,
        "description_it": "Situato su una spiaggia appartata, l'Alunan Resort offre un'esperienza moderna e tranquilla.\nDurante il soggiorno potrete immergervi nell'unica piscina a sfioro di Perhentian, affacciata su una scogliera.\nLa struttura propone la Sunset Cruise, la crociera a bordo del primo e unico Sport Yacht dell'isola, che vi permetterà di ammirare il leggendario tramonto.\nIl resort osserva le indicazioni dello snorkeling ecologico, organizzato con guide qualificate Emergency First Rescue (EFR).\nPotrete rendere la vostra vacanza più significativa partecipando all'Alunan Coral Project insieme ai 4 biologi marini della struttura.\nDotate di terrazza solarium privata con vista sul mare, le camere dispongono di aria condizionata, parquet, scrivania, appendiabiti e TV satellitare a schermo piatto.",
